# Release APK → prod mobile-pack

After any **release** Android build:

1. `scripts/build_apk.sh` (calls `scripts/publish_downloads.sh`) or run publish explicitly.
2. Upload targets on `krl@karielan-hub`:
   - `~/punzh-dict/mobile-pack/punzh-dict-latest.apk`
   - `~/punzh-dict/mobile-pack/app-manifest.json` (обязательно вместе с APK)
3. Public URLs:
   - APK file: `https://punzhina.krc.karelia.ru/mobile-pack/punzh-dict-latest.apk`
   - Tracked download: `https://punzhina.krc.karelia.ru/app/apk/`
   - App manifest: `https://punzhina.krc.karelia.ru/mobile-pack/app-manifest.json`
4. Also copy versioned APK/AAB into `store/rustore/` for store consoles (do not commit `*.apk` / `*.aab`).
5. Do **not** commit APK or `app-manifest.json` into the punzh-dict git repo `app/downloads/`.

## app-manifest.json (F2)

- Owner: **this repo's** `scripts/publish_downloads.sh` only. Do not ask punzh-dict /
  Django / `publish_mobile_pack.sh` to write or rewrite it (pack `manifest.json` is
  dictionary data; app updates are independent).
- An APK upload **without** updating `app-manifest.json` is **incomplete** — non-store
  clients will not see the new `version_code`.
- Fields: `version_name`, `version_code` (int from `pubspec` `+N`), `apk_url`
  (default `/app/apk/`), `published_at` (UTC). Client compares **only** `version_code`.
